        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord, how long shall the wicked, how long shall the wicked triumph?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "Alma 40:26; D&C 29:41; 121:8 (1–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "How long shall they utter and speak hard things? and all the workers of iniquity boast themselves?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 29
          },
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "They break in pieces thy people, O Lord, and afflict thine heritage.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "They slay the widow and the stranger, and murder the fatherless.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 9,
            "text": "3 Ne. 24:5."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "3 Ne. 24:5.",
            "prettyString": "3 Nephi 24:5",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "3nephi",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 24,
                    "end": 24,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 5,
