        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Blessed is the man whom thou chastenest, O Lord, and teachest him out of thy law;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "TG Chastening."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 10
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Chastening.",
            "prettyString": "TG Chastening",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Chastening",
                "entryId": "tg-chastening",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "That thou mayest give him rest from the days of adversity, until the pit be digged for the wicked.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:13",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "For the Lord will not cast off his people, neither will he forsake his inheritance.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "Deut. 31:6; 3 Ne. 22:10 (7–10); D&C 35:25."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "But judgment shall return unto righteousness: and all the upright in heart shall follow it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "Who will rise up for me against the evildoers? or who will stand up for me against the workers of iniquity?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 49
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Unless the Lord had been my help, my soul had almost dwelt in silence.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 24
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "When I said, My foot slippeth; thy mercy, O Lord, held me up.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:18",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "In the multitude of my thoughts within me thy comforts delight my soul.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:19",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall the throne of iniquity have fellowship with thee, which frameth mischief by a law?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 78,
            "text": "TG Injustice."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Injustice.",
            "prettyString": "TG Injustice",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Injustice",
                "entryId": "tg-injustice",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:20",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "They gather themselves together against the soul of the righteous, and condemn the innocent blood.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:21",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "But the Lord is my defence; and my God is the rock of my refuge.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 94:22",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 94,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And he shall bring upon them their own iniquity, and shall cut them off in their own wickedness; yea, the Lord our God shall cut them off.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 101
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
